    "detailed_description": "When all of the stars in the sky go dark, it becomes your mission to venture to the planet at the center of the universe and re-illuminate the pilot light. Your only guidance to your goal is the light from the engine of your rocket.<br><br>Navigate through tight spaces and dodge dangerous obstacles placed by peculiar enemies coming from the darkness. One wrong touch to your rocket will spell certain doom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 8 Worlds<br></li><li> 80 Levels<br></li><li> 8 Bosses<br></li><li> Challenge Modes<br></li><li> Voice-acted cutscenes</li></ul>",
